OL,3,GNEWSAFears potential estate work could
OL,4,A'trap' residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the last residents on a
OL,7,FCambridge housing estate due for
OL,8,Fredevelopment said potential road
OL,9,Fclosures could leave his disabled wife
OL,10,F"trapped".
OL,12,FCambridge City Council approved the
OL,13,Fdemolition of the Ekin Road estate in
OL,14,F2024. Now planning documents suggest
OL,15,Fremaining residents could lose access
OL,16,Fto their driveways while work takes
OL,17,Fplace for 57 weeks.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
