OL,3,GNEWSAFears potential estate work could
OL,4,A'trap' residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary car park is proposed off
OL,7,FWadloes Road, but Peter Hamblin, 70,
OL,8,Ffears his wife, who has multiple
OL,9,Fsclerosis, will be left "trapped in the
OL,10,Fhouse".
OL,12,FGerri Bird, Labour councillor and
OL,13,Fcabinet member for housing, said the
OL,14,Ftime-scale was an "initial estimate"
OL,15,Fnot a "confirmed road closure", and the
OL,16,Froad would only be closed when
OL,17,Fessential.
